*> Sections, qualified names, declaratives, and resolution errors.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DECLARATIVES.
IO-ERRORS SECTION.
    USE AFTER STANDARD ERROR PROCEDURE ON IN-FILE.
LOG-IT.
    DISPLAY "I/O ERROR".
END DECLARATIVES.
MAIN SECTION.
START-UP.
    PERFORM LOAD
    PERFORM CLEANUP IN WRAP-UP
    PERFORM REPORT-SECTION
    GO TO BRANCH-A BRANCH-B DEPENDING ON CHOICE.
FALLS-HERE.
    PERFORM NO-SUCH-PARAGRAPH
    PERFORM CLEANUP
    STOP RUN.
LOAD.
    CONTINUE.
REPORT-SECTION SECTION.
    DISPLAY "REPORT".
BRANCH-A.
    DISPLAY "A".
BRANCH-B.
    DISPLAY "B".
WRAP-UP SECTION.
CLEANUP.
    CONTINUE.
OTHER-SECTION SECTION.
CLEANUP.
    CONTINUE.
